// Rule 1 - Brute Force: Multiple Failed Logons
// Severity: Medium | MITRE ATT&CK: Credential Access - T1110 Brute Force
// Schedule: run every 5 minutes, look back 1 hour | Alert when results > 0
// Suppression: 1 hour after an alert fires (added after tuning - see report)
// Entities: Account -> TargetAccount, IP -> IpAddress
//
// Fires when one account receives 10 or more failed logons (EventID 4625)
// from the same source IP within a 15-minute window.

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4625
| summarize Failures = count() by TargetAccount, IpAddress, bin(TimeGenerated, 15m)
| where Failures >= 10
